{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115035200060-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115050212\"/><p>事發在豐碩樓一單位</p><p>今日(14日)晚上9時17分，沙田碩門邨豐碩樓一單位姓龍(44歲)男住戶，被其兒子發現在上址暈倒。救援人員接報到場，事主現場被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T21:10:45.496902+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T19:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T21:04:09.255393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T21:04:09.255393+00:00","content_hash":"334afbfe92fc3ac76d3f3f21d46609998e27d7df298c6cf02f464e35ac932d52","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}